{"person_name": "Lady Jessica", "traits": [{"trait_name": "openness", "score": 0.7, "confidence": 0.8, "evidence_spans": [{"text": "the Lady Jessica, who guided her son in the Bene Gesserit Way", "start": 204, "end": 258}, {"text": "the wisdom of seeding the known universe with a prophecy pattern for the protection of B.G. personnel has long been appreciated", "start": 1085, "end": 1185}]}, {"trait_name": "conscientiousness", "score": 0.6, "confidence": 0.7, "evidence_spans": [{"text": "Jessica took her hand from Paul's shoulder. \"Your Reverence, I --\" \"Jessica, you know it must be done.\" Jessica straightened. \"Yes . . . of course.\"", "start": 276, "end": 366}, {"text": "All the special training from Hawat and his mother -the mnemonics, the focusing of awareness, the muscle control and sharpening of sensitivities", "start": 1320, "end": 1420}]}, {"trait_name": "neuroticism", "score": 0.6, "confidence": 0.7, "evidence_spans": [{"text": "Jessica's hand went to Paul's shoulder, tightened there. For a heartbeat, fear pulsed through her palm.", "start": 66, "end": 146}, {"text": "Yet he felt an angry apprehension at the fear he sensed radiating from his mother.", "start": 426, "end": 486}]}], "source_passage_ids": ["dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_5", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_6", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_22", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_33", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_34", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_58", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_59", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_65", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_88", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_92", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_108", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_109", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_128", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_167", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_168", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_169", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_194", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_215", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_216", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_271", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_302", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_303", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_334", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_389", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_501", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_607", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_624", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_669", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_670", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_673", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_674"]}
{"person_name": "Reverend Mother", "traits": [{"trait_name": "openness", "score": 0.7, "confidence": 0.8, "evidence_spans": [{"text": "The Reverend Mother ignored the view. She was feeling her age this morning, more than a little petulant.", "start": 497, "end": 573}, {"text": "The Reverend Mother must combine the seductive wiles of a courtesan with the untouchable majesty of a virgin goddess.", "start": 1225, "end": 1321}]}, {"trait_name": "conscientiousness", "score": 0.8, "confidence": 0.9, "evidence_spans": [{"text": "But here was a mission that required personal attention from a Bene Gesserit-with-the-Sight.", "start": 574, "end": 644}, {"text": "The Reverend Mother stared at him, wondering: Did I hear criticism in his voice? \"We carry a heavy burden,\" she said.", "start": 1080, "end": 1154}]}, {"trait_name": "agreeableness", "score": 0.3, "confidence": 0.7, "evidence_spans": [{"text": "Damn that Jessica! the Reverend Mother thought. If only she 'd borne us a girl as she was ordered to do!", "start": 645, "end": 725}, {"text": "What do I want you to say? What do I want you to say?\" The old voice carried a tone of cruel mimicry.", "start": 1506, "end": 1575}]}], "source_passage_ids": ["dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_3", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_4", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_5", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_12", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_13", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_25", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_26", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_28", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_29", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_30", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_31", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_32", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_35", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_36", "dune-1-