{"person_name": "Paul Atreides", "traits": [{"trait_name": "openness", "score": 0.8, "confidence": 0.9, "evidence_spans": [{"text": "She said a good ruler has to learn his world's language, that it's different for every world.", "start": 1085, "end": 1159}, {"text": "Paul followed his mother's example, gestalting the room, seeing the workbench down one side, the walls of featureless rock.", "start": 4085, "end": 4168}]}, {"trait_name": "conscientiousness", "score": 0.7, "confidence": 0.9, "evidence_spans": [{"text": "Paul felt that all his past, every experience before this night, had become sand curling in an hourglass.", "start": 2785, "end": 2855}, {"text": "Paul thought back to the moment of impotent rage as the strange 'thopter dived out of the night onto them.", "start": 2995, "end": 3065}]}, {"trait_name": "agreeableness", "score": 0.6, "confidence": 0.7, "evidence_spans": [{"text": "Paul shrugged. \"Then she said a good ruler has to learn his world's language, that it's different for every world.\"", "start": 1080, "end": 1159}, {"text": "Paul returned his attention to the cages, saw that the animals were brownwinged bats.", "start": 4325, "end": 4375}]}, {"trait_name": "neuroticism", "score": 0.6, "confidence": 0.7, "evidence_spans": [{"text": "Paul felt a sharp pang of fear. He looked across at the Mentat's puzzled frown.", "start": 485, "end": 545}, {"text": "Paul felt the thought gall him, but could not deny the wisdom in what they did.", "start": 2925, "end": 2985}]}], "source_passage_ids": ["dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_36", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_37", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_188", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_245", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_246", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_287", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_288", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_289", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_296", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_551", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_616", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_670"]}
{"person_name": "Mother", "traits": [{"trait_name": "openness", "score": 0.6, "confidence": 0.7, "evidence_spans": [{"text": "Jessica took a deep breath. \". . . this test you're about to receive . . . it's important to me.\"", "start": 451, "end": 515}, {"text": "Jessica looked down at her right hand, flexed the fingers, remembering the pain, the terror, the anger.", "start": 1683, "end": 1755}]}, {"trait_name": "conscientiousness", "score": 0.7, "confidence": 0.7, "evidence_spans": [{"text": "Jessica's hand went to Paul's shoulder, tightened there. For a heartbeat, fear pulsed through her palm. Then she had herself under control.", "start": 270, "end": 384}, {"text": "Jessica stepped into the room, closed the door and stood with her back to it. My son lives, she thought.", "start": 1015, "end": 1080}]}, {"trait_name": "neuroticism", "score": 0.6, "confidence": 0.7, "evidence_spans": [{"text": "For a heartbeat, fear pulsed through her palm. Then she had herself under control.", "start": 324, "end": 384}, {"text": "Jessica looked down at her right hand, flexed the fingers, remembering the pain, the terror, the anger.", "start": 1683, "end": 1755}]}], "source_passage_ids": ["dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_0", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_1", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_2", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_3", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_4", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_5", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_6", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_7", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_9", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_10", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_11", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_12", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_13", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_21", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-fra